; elided amounts, assertions and assignments are worked out on the amounts as written; only then
; are the amounts valued. The result need not balance: the transactions are not checked again.
P 2026-01-01 X 2 EUR
P 2026-01-01 Y 3 X
P 2026-01-01 EUR 1.1 USD

2026-01-02 an elided amount takes the cost of a priced posting, then is valued
    a  3 X @ 4 EUR
    b

2026-01-02 an assertion compares 5 X, not their value
    c  5 X = 5 X
    d

2026-01-03 an assignment fills in 3 X (8 minus 5)
    c  = 8 X
    d

2026-01-04 the amount left out is the sum of two commodities, valued apart
    c  1 X = 9 X
    e  3 Y
    d

2026-01-05 a total assignment zeroes X and Y: the amounts add up to zero in EUR
    c  == 3 Y
    d

2026-01-06 an inclusive assignment
    c:s  4 X
    c  =* 12 X
    d
